  "2026-11-06T04:47:14.281Z",codex-agent,"Verified installed SDK 2026.11.5 runtime declarations: PmClient accepts root-oriented PmClientOptions; public native CAS signatures exist and are used. Open upstream issues 1399, 1587 and 1588 own backend-neutral native ports and reusable database conformance. Unsupported hosts refuse before storage access. No arbitrary-provider production certification is claimed."
  "2026-11-06T21:17:05.092Z",codex-sol,"PR #4 certifies real directory SDK trackers and negative capability refusals, not arbitrary native providers. The installed PmClientOptions remains root-oriented; authoritative backend-neutral lifecycle/CAS conformance and authorization receipts remain with existing upstream issues #1399, #1587 and #1588. Keep open; no provider certification is inferred from method-shaped ports."
